@using CrossBuy.BL
@using CrossBuy.BL.Hospital
@using CrossBuy.Models.Context.Hospital
@model HospitalPatientPage
@inject Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Localization.IHtmlLocalizer<CrossBuy.HospitalResources> T
@{
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_LayoutHospital.cshtml";
    ViewData["Title"] = T["Patient registry"].Value;
    bool canRegister = ViewBag.CanRegister == true;
    string? q = ViewBag.Query as string;
    var today = DateTime.UtcNow;
    int pages = Math.Max(1, (int)Math.Ceiling(Model.Total / (double)Model.PageSize));
    string Initials(string en) { var p = (en ?? "").Trim().Split(' ', StringSplitOptions.RemoveEmptyEntries); return ((p.Length > 0 ? p[0][..1] : "") + (p.Length > 1 ? p[1][..1] : "")).ToUpperInvariant(); }
}
<link href="~/css/hospital.css" rel="stylesheet" asp-append-version="true" />

<div class="d-flex flex-column flex-column-fluid">
    <div id="kt_app_toolbar" class="app-toolbar pt-6 pb-2"><div class="app-container container-fluid d-flex flex-stack flex-wrap gap-3">
        <div class="page-title d-flex flex-column justify-content-center gap-1">
            <h1 class="page-heading text-gray-900 fw-bold fs-3 m-0">@T["Patient registry"]</h1>
            <ul class="breadcrumb breadcrumb-separatorless fw-semibold fs-7 my-0">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item text-muted">@T["Hospital"]</li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><span class="bullet bg-gray-500 w-5px h-2px"></span></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item text-muted">@T["Patients"]</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        @if (canRegister)
        {
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 gap-lg-3 d-print-none">
                <a href="@Url.Action("RegisterPatient")" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary"><i class="ki-outline ki-plus fs-4"></i>@T["Register patient"]</a>
            </div>
        }
    </div></div>

    <div id="kt_app_content" class="app-content flex-column-fluid"><div class="app-container container-fluid">

        <div class="row g-5 g-xl-8 mb-5">
            @foreach (var s in new[] {
                (T["Total patients"].Value, Model.Stats.Total, T["Every open file"].Value, "text-gray-900"),
                (T["Registered this month"].Value, Model.Stats.ThisMonth, T["New files since the 1st"].Value, "text-gray-900"),
                (T["Possible duplicates"].Value, Model.Stats.PossibleDuplicates, T["Same name and date of birth"].Value, Model.Stats.PossibleDuplicates > 0 ? "text-danger" : "text-gray-900"),
                (T["Recorded allergy"].Value, Model.Stats.WithAllergy, T["Files carrying an allergy alert"].Value, "text-gray-900") })
            {
                <div class="col-sm-6 col-xl-3">
                    <div class="card card-flush h-100"><div class="card-body py-5">
                        <div class="text-muted fw-semibold fs-7 mb-1">@s.Item1</div>
                        <div class="fs-2hx fw-bold @s.Item4 hp-num">@s.Item2.ToString("N0")</div>
                        <div class="text-muted fs-8 mt-1">@s.Item3</div>
                    </div></div>
                </div>
            }
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header border-0 pt-6">
                <div class="card-title align-items-start flex-column m-0">
                    <span class="card-label fw-bold text-gray-900 fs-4">@T["Patient registry"]</span>
                    <span class="text-muted mt-1 fw-semibold fs-7"><span class="hp-num">@Model.Total.ToString("N0")</span> @T["file(s)"]</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card-toolbar">
                    <form method="get" action="@Url.Action("Patients")" class="d-flex align-items-center position-relative my-1">
                        <i class="ki-outline ki-magnifier fs-3 position-absolute ms-4"></i>
                        <input type="text" name="q" value="@q" class="form-control form-control-solid w-250px ps-12" placeholder="@T["Name, MRN, ID or mobile..."]" autocomplete="off" />
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body pt-2">
                @if (Model.Rows.Count == 0)
                {
                    <div class="text-center text-muted py-15">
                        <i class="ki-outline ki-profile-user fs-3x text-gray-300 d-block mb-4"></i>
                        @(string.IsNullOrEmpty(q) ? T["No patients yet. Register the first file."] : T["No file matches this search."])
                    </div>
                }
                else
                {
                    <div class="table-responsive">
                        <table class="table align-middle table-row-dashed fs-6 gy-4 mb-0">
                            <thead><tr class="text-start text-gray-500 fw-bold fs-7 text-uppercase gs-0">
                                <th>@T["Patient"]</th><th class="w-150px">@T["MRN"]</th><th>@T["ID number"]</th><th>@T["Mobile"]</th><th>@T["Registered"]</th><th class="text-end w-125px"></th>
                            </tr></thead>
                            <tbody class="fw-semibold text-gray-700">
                                @foreach (var p in Model.Rows)
                                {
                                    var age = HospitalPatientService.AgeOn(p.BirthDate, today);
                                    var url = Url.Action("Patient", new { id = p.Id });
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>
                                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center min-w-0">
                                                <div class="symbol symbol-40px symbol-circle flex-shrink-0">@if (p.PhotoPath != null) {<img src="@p.PhotoPath" alt="" style="object-fit:cover" data-initials="@Initials(p.NameEn)" />} else {<span class="symbol-label fw-bold hp-initials">@Initials(p.NameEn)</span>}</div>
                                                <div class="d-flex flex-column ms-3 min-w-0">
                                                    <a href="@url" class="text-gray-900 text-hover-primary fs-6 fw-bold text-truncate">@DisplayName.Of(p.Name, p.NameEn)</a>
                                                    <span class="text-muted fw-semibold fs-7 text-truncate">@if (age != null) {<span class="hp-num">@age</span> @T["y"] <text> · </text>}@(p.Sex == HospitalPatientSex.Male ? T["Male"] : T["Female"])@if (p.HasAllergy) {<span class="badge badge-light-danger fs-9 ms-2">@T["Allergy"]</span>}</span>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                        <td><span class="badge hp-code fw-bold fs-8 hp-num">@p.Mrn</span></td>
                                        <td><span class="hp-num text-gray-700">@(p.NationalId ?? "—")</span></td>
                                        <td><span class="hp-num text-gray-700">@(p.Phone ?? "—")</span></td>
                                        <td><span class="hp-num text-gray-700">@p.CreatedAt.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")</span></td>
                                        <td class="text-end"><a href="@url" class="btn btn-sm btn-light-primary">@T["Open file"]</a></td>
                                    </tr>
                                }
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                    @if (pages > 1)
                    {
                        <div class="d-flex flex-stack flex-wrap pt-5">
                            <div class="fs-7 text-muted">@T["Page"] <span class="hp-num">@Model.Page / @pages</span></div>
                            <ul class="pagination">
                                <li class="page-item previous @(Model.Page <= 1 ? "disabled" : "")"><a class="page-link" href="@Url.Action("Patients", new { q, page = Model.Page - 1 })"><i class="previous"></i></a></li>
                                @for (int i = Math.Max(1, Model.Page - 2); i <= Math.Min(pages, Model.Page + 2); i++)
                                {
                                    <li class="page-item @(i == Model.Page ? "active" : "")"><a class="page-link hp-num" href="@Url.Action("Patients", new { q, page = i })">@i</a></li>
                                }
                                <li class="page-item next @(Model.Page >= pages ? "disabled" : "")"><a class="page-link" href="@Url.Action("Patients", new { q, page = Model.Page + 1 })"><i class="next"></i></a></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    }
                }
            </div>
        </div>
    </div></div>
</div>
